Research and evaluation use only. Not for commercial use.

These weights are a LoRA adapter trained on data derived from ExpGuardMix
(6rightjade/expguardmix). That dataset's access gate requires affirming research-only
use, a restriction narrower than its CC-BY-4.0 licence. This artifact passes that
restriction forward.

The base model, Qwen/Qwen3Guard-Gen-0.6B, is Apache-2.0. This adapter is not.

No part of the training corpus is redistributed with these weights.

